PROJECT PHILOSOPHY
===================================================================================
🎯 Core Mission
MediConnect bridges the healthcare gap for India's rural population by providing:

Accessible healthcare via mobile phones (no computer needed)
Offline functionality for areas with poor connectivity
Voice-based interaction for illiterate/semi-literate users
Multi-language support (Telugu, Hindi, English)
Family helper feature allowing literate family members to operate on behalf of patients
✅ ALWAYS DO
Principle	Implementation
Phone-only authentication	Firebase Phone Auth (no email required)
FREE services only	All services have $0 cost
Multi-language	Telugu, Hindi, English in all user-facing content
Voice support	Web Speech API for input/output
Offline-first	PWA with service workers, IndexedDB
Simple UI	Large buttons, icons, minimal text
Low bandwidth	Compressed assets, lazy loading
❌ NEVER DO
Avoid	Reason
Email requirements	Rural users don't have email
Paid services (Twilio, AWS)	Must be 100% free
English-only content	Most users speak Telugu/Hindi
Complex forms	Users may be illiterate
Docker	Developer unfamiliar
Heavy data usage	Limited mobile data
Small touch targets	Difficult for elderly users
